#: musicxml2ly.py:5164
msgid ""
"Convert FILE with MusicXML data to a LilyPond input file.\n"
"\n"
"By default, the output file is called 'FILE.ly' for input file 'FILE.xml'.\n"
"If FILE is '-', read from standard input (and write to standard output).\n"
"\n"
"If FILE cannot be found, 'FILE.xml', 'FILE.musicxml', and 'FILE.mxl' are\n"
"also tried as input files.\n"
msgstr ""
"Konvertera FIL med MusicXML-data till en LilyPond-indatafil.\n"
"\n"
"Som standard heter utdatafilen ”FIL.ly” för indatafilen\n"
"”FIL.xml”. Om FIL är ”-” läses standardindata\n"
"\n"
"(och standardutdata skrivs). Om FIL inte hittas provas\n"
"även ”FIL.xml”, ”FIL.musicxml” och ”FIL.mxl” som indatafiler.\n"

